--TEST--
A method the manifest declares a source returns a tainted result even with no argument, so it cannot reach a sink until it is escaped — `rule:security/extension-declares-sink-or-source`
--EXTENSION--
ledger
--FILE--
<?nvs
use Shop\Ledger;

// `fetch` returns a line from outside the program, so the result is tainted.
tainted string $line = Ledger::fetch();

// `writeLine` does not accept a tainted value.
Ledger::writeLine($line);
echo "unreachable\n";
--EXPECT--

--EXPECTF-ERROR--
error[E0401]: expected `string`, found `tainted string`
%A
error: aborting due to 1 error
To read what a code means and how to fix it, run `nvs agent show <code>`.
